`` runs the job in a separate thread with its own event loop, but\nthe ``new_log_evt`` waiters live in the daemon loop. ``asyncio.Event.set()`` is\nnot thread-safe, so without hopping back onto the daemon loop the terminal DONE\nnotification is lost and ``ws_poll_info`` hangs forever (the desktop app's\n&quot;finalizing&quot; step never completes and the connection eventually drops).\n``from_threadpool`` mimics sync routes (``/update/start``), which call\n``run_command`` from FastAPI's threadpool, with no running loop.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"001d7db05b99187760d8c977ec2398af","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"234d4be8a261a92f140d9497084bd3b6","type":"before","name":"tmp_path_factory","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"8696488ddbcdb58eaaadaa69dda712ad","type":"before","name":"_no_telemetry","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"b3e9e24b2d5270f18158f9c825addfeb","type":"before","name":"monkeypatch","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"e2cd1fa989701c25c87e7fc9c2e8c08e","type":"before","name":"_isolated_hf_credentials","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"9527384c786b997f328516ad3d3a5a44","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1}],"teardown":[{"id":"c0e0828923e12267b0cf55aabb958fb7","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"622fef2f3763bd32a3fa74c5dd598f5c","type":"after","name":"monkeypatch::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[{"id":"278332b93138a90eb55abbb25f444196","name":"test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread[False]","fullName":"tests.unit_tests.test_bg_job_register#test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread","environment":"default","status":"passed","retries":[],"start":1794845634204,"stop":1794845634308,"duration":104,"labels":[{"name":"tag","value":